{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18133","headline":"答张十一功曹 · 韩愈","name":"答张十一功曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山净江空水见沙，哀猿啼处两三家。\n篔簹竞长纤纤笋，踯躅闲开艳艳花。\n未报恩波知死所，莫令炎瘴送生涯。\n吟君诗罢看双鬓，斗觉霜毛一半加。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}